  "description": "Brought together by fate.\nHyungbae is a bit of a workaholic. Underappreciated and overworked, he feels burnt out at his current job. Enter Deokbae, a carefree dog that has a mind of his own! Follow Hyungbae and his canine companion as they navigate the ups and downs of life, bringing a whole new meaning to the word \"family.\"\n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes an epilogue.*",
